@host = http://localhost:5258
@apiKey = erk_REPLACE_ME

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/v1/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Send an email
POST {{host}}/api/v1/emails
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": [ "someone@example.com" ],
  "subject": "Hello from EmailRelayAPI",
  "html": "<p>Hi there</p>",
  "text": "Hi there",
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-1"
}

### Get status
GET {{host}}/api/v1/emails/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List failed
GET {{host}}/api/v1/emails?status=failed&pageSize=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Rotate my key
POST {{host}}/api/v1/me/keys/rotate
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Admin login (cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin@123" }

### Dashboard (cookie or admin-scoped key)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/dashboard
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
